      "skos:prefLabel": "Conversational AI",
      "skos:definition": "The spoken companion for Hybrid Intelligences—a chatbot grounded in the program ontology. Voice is one layer of a hybrid dynamic knowledge architecture of concepts, essays, documentation, visualization, conversational AI, and program materials for embodied leadership and creativity in the era of AI. It explains concepts from their definitions and relations, can be interrupted, and opens from Talk about this on any node.",
