    {
      "@id": "https://marlonbarrios.github.io/hybrid-intelligences/ontology#andrew_hix",
      "@type": [
        "skos:Concept",
        "hi:NetworkNode"
      ],
      "skos:prefLabel": "Andrew Hix",
      "skos:definition": "Wednesday July 22 — Future Lab: sound and listening. Writer, storyteller, and integrative therapies practitioner at UF Health Shands Arts in Medicine; licensed massage therapist who teaches tai chi, qigong, and mindfulness meditation to hospital patients. University of Florida graduate (2009) and Florida School of Massage (2011); co-principal investigator on integrative-medicine studies. Practices tai chi as a martial art; attention and listening as method.",
      "skos:broader": {
